+/// 探针副本专用：造完的起步镜像上照几何核那一套阶梯在 CPU 臂上不计时地交替跑（每一级都从同一份起步镜像拷池，不要卡），
+/// 每一级跑完把发布路径探针的表整份取走，按 `phase=compaction_cpu_arm_user_changes_<次数>` 打逐次发布行与分布行，另打一行
+/// `name=compaction_probe`（批数、搬走的单元数、探针数到的发布次数、挂钟）；几何没成形的不跑，打一行说明。
+fn probe_the_compaction_publishes_on_the_cpu_arm(
+    product: &mut ProductWriter,
+    command: &ConstructionTimingCommand,
+    live_data_units: u64,
+    image: &StartingImage,
+) {
+    let counted_after_the_construction = singlefs_core::publish_change_probe::take_the_counts();
+    let fields_of_the_command = format!(
+        "tier={} live_data_units={live_data_units} chunks={}",
+        command.tier.name(),
+        command.storage.name()
+    );
+    if !image.construction.geometry.is_formed() {
+        product.emit(
+            "compaction_probe",
+            &format!(
+                "{fields_of_the_command} geometry_formed=false ran=no counted_after_the_construction={}",
+                counted_after_the_construction.len()
+            ),
+        );
+        return;
+    }
+    let memory_leaked = GpuMemoryLeakedInThisProcess::with_nothing_leaked();
+    for user_changes in LOCKSTEP_USER_CHANGES_LADDER {
+        let setting = LockstepRunSetting {
+            image,
+            discrete_gpus: &[],
+            discrete_gpus_of_the_every_card_arm: &[],
+            memory_leaked: &memory_leaked,
+            vulkan_instance: None,
+            user_changes,
+            batch_units: BATCH_UNITS_AT_THE_MAIN_SAMPLING_POINT,
+        };
+        let started = Instant::now();
+        let run = run_lockstep_once(&setting, LOCKSTEP_ARMS[0], 0);
+        let seconds = started.elapsed().as_secs_f64();
+        let counted = singlefs_core::publish_change_probe::take_the_counts();
+        let phase = format!("compaction_cpu_arm_user_changes_{user_changes}");
+        for (name, fields) in probe_lines_of_the_phase(&phase, &counted) {
+            product.emit(&name, &format!("{fields_of_the_command} {fields}"));
+        }
+        let (batches, units_relocated, outcome) = match &run {
+            Ok(summary) => (summary.batches, summary.units_relocated, "ok".to_string()),
+            Err(reason) => (0, 0, field_value(reason)),
+        };
+        product.emit(
+            "compaction_probe",
+            &format!(
+                "{fields_of_the_command} geometry_formed=true ran=yes user_changes={user_changes} outcome={outcome} \
+                 batches={batches} units_relocated={units_relocated} publishes_counted={} counted_after_the_construction={} seconds={seconds:.3}",
+                counted.len(),
+                counted_after_the_construction.len()
+            ),
+        );
+        if run.is_err() || batches >= MINIMUM_BATCHES_PER_RUN {
+            break;
+        }
+    }
+}
